{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2022-07-05 11:32:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP PROMOTES TALENT AND EMPLOYEE EXPERIENCE LEADERS TO SUPPORT LONG-TERM PEOPLE STRATEGY', 'text': "RADNOR, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE:LNC) RECENTLY ANNOUNCED TWO PROMOTIONS AND APPOINTMENTS TO ITS CORPORATE LEADERSHIP GROUP, WHICH COMPRISES LINCOLN'S TOP EXECUTIVE LEADERS, FROM THE HUMAN RESOURCES ORGANIZATION, LED BY JEN WARNE, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF PEOPLE OFFICER. KATE FEATHER HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, HEAD OF EMPLOYEE EXPERIENCE AND TALENT DEVELOPMENT. MICHAEL (MIKE) KELLAR HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, HEAD OF TALENT."}